        "locator": "卷5 / 颐 / 彖曰 / 0007册.djvu/411"
      }
    ],
    "reviewId": "review-h27-tuan"
  },
  "greatImage": {
    "id": "h27-great-image",
    "original": "山下有雷，颐；君子以慎言语，节饮食。",
